<title>USA: First American to buy back 4.0 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>First American to buy back 4.0 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First American Corp said Friday it had authorized the repurchase of an additional 4.0 million common shares.</p>
<p>The company has bought back about 2.7 million of the 3.0 million shares previously authorized for repurchase.</p>
<p>The company has about 58.0 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
